diff --git a/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..2ee51b94d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Commas in regular expressions passed to regexp-csv options such as ``bad-names-rgxs`` are no longer
+treated as separators when they are part of a quantifier like ``{1,3}``, a character class,
+a group, or are escaped with a backslash (``\,``).
+
+Closes #7229
